{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aren’t sampled again.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence, which ends once the tracker has finished and every report has been read. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference"},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"title":"samplingDropReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV19samplingDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA08SamplingD6ReportVGvp","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L391"},"role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SamplingDropReport":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/samplingdropreport","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Events a tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference"},{"text":"s left out: the event’s name, how many were left out and when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they were tracked.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SamplingDropReport","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","title":"Sampler","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","title":"samplingDropReports","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","te